The Qureshis are a noble tengu family of [[Geography/Austrene/index|Austrene]] and a leading patron of [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]]. [[People/Adal|Adal]] is the head of the household in [[People/Anzu|Anzu]]'s generation, with three children born as triplets: [[People/Anzu|Anzu]], his brother [[People/Aguirzu|Aguirzu]], and his sister [[People/Galzu|Galzu]]. The family keeps barristers on retainer, enough to press a legal matter against one opponent at a time.

In recent months both [[Org/General Thematics/index|General Thematics]] and [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt]] have pulled back from their contracts with Belvedere and the Qureshis, saying only that they mean to focus their energies elsewhere.
